DESCRIPTION <b>ora_trace_fetch</b> is the rear portion of the concierge system.
<br><br>
<b>ora_trace_fetch</b> processes snippet_requests that it retrieves from a table
in the database, by repeatedly attempting to retrieve data from wave_servers.
It has the ability to continually retrieve new data for a snippet as it 
becomes avaialable, thus allowing a snippet to grow incrementally over time.
